Changes for 1.11.0:

- sup-cli: added ParseOrReport, which reports the outcome of the parsing on behalf of main.
- sup-cli: CommandLineParser::GetValue<T> accurately converts scalars; overload with fallback.
- sup-cli: IsSet is applicable only for defined options and throws on unknown flags.
- sup-cli: added CommandLineParser::IsHelpRequested and GetParseError for main.cpp convenience.
- sup-cli: correcly handling the order of positional options; minor API refactoring.
- sup-cli: possibility to treat an empty string as default value.
- sup-cli: added collection of own exceptions for cli.
- sup-cli: option and positional values keep the whitespace (bugfix).
- sup-cli: CommandLineParser is movable, better method constantness.
- Build coverage with -O0 by selecting Debug over RelWithDebInfo
- Instrument test code for coverage by setting flags before add_subdirectory
- sup-xml: added Google Benchmark based performance tests for TreeData
- sup-xml: added TreeData::AddChild overload taking an rvalue reference
- sup-xml: parsing moves subtrees instead of copying them and no longer rescans siblings

